ity:\n\n$$\n1-x<-\\sqrt[6]{2}\\,\\text{or}\\,1-x>\\sqrt[6]{2}\n$$\n\nWe can solve each inequality using the usual methods.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-x & <-\\sqrt[6]{2} &  &  & 1-x & >\\sqrt[6]{2} \\\\ -x & <-\\sqrt[6]{2}-1 &  &  & -x & >\\sqrt[6]{2}-1 \\\\ x & >1+\\sqrt[6]{2} &  &  & x & <1-\\sqrt[6]{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution is\n\n$$\nx<1-\\sqrt[6]{2}\\,\\text{or}\\,x>1+\\sqrt[6]{2}.\n$$" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281927 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281928 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281929 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281930 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281931 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1041 "selection" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281927 13194139534201 true] [17592186281926 1110 #uuid "ab0bfeb7-ca05-59e9-a5c1-d4cf1565de8e" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281927 1034 "x<1-\\sqrt[6]{2}\\,\\text{or}\\,x>1+\\sqrt[6]{2}" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281927 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534201 true] [17592186281927 1111 #uuid "1a93e023-6e43-5c3b-9cf3-6eca2a191b62" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281928 1034 "x>1+\\sqrt[6]{2}" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281928 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534201 true] [17592186281928 1111 #uuid "45855a7c-ba17-53d1-b64d-be17f5c1db8d" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281929 1034 "x<-1-\\sqrt[6]{2}" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281929 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534201 true] [17592186281929 1111 #uuid "3ed63e80-29cc-506a-b1ad-ce050e7d3a6a" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281930 1034 "x>-2" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281930 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534201 true] [17592186281930 1111 #uuid "01124737-6c5e-5c9e-b7e3-8ff76ee8dc37" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281931 1034 "x<0" 13194139534201 true] [17592186281931 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453